/*
 * Implements semantic validation for struct constructors.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of struct-constructor parameters, attributes, and throwers,
 *   - validation of pre-construction logic(field initialization or redirect),
 *   - validation of the constructor body,
 *   - construction of the final CtorPrototypeValue,
 *   - generation of the constructor frame(FrameGenerator),
 *   - detection of illegal redirect patterns and field re-initialization,
 *   - integration with template instantiation.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::ctor::struct_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/ctor/struct_.yr
 * @Author(s):
